# platform.rp2350_touch_lcd_154.touch

The board's CST816 capacitive touch controller: reset on GP16 and interrupt on
GP15, at address 0x15.

It shares I2C1 with the board's IMU and codec: SDA on GP6 and SCL on GP7.
Each provider configures that bus before its first transfer, which is
idempotent and means no provider depends on another having been initialised
first.
